# --- Rust ---
# Build cache for every crate + every cross-compile target (Android triples
# included). Fully regenerated by `cargo build`.
/target/

# --- Android / Gradle ---
# Gradle build output (compiled classes, intermediates, assembled APKs).
android/app/build/
android/build/
# Gradle's local cache + Kotlin daemon state.
android/.gradle/
android/.kotlin/
# Machine-specific SDK path Android Studio generates on first open.
android/local.properties
# Compiled native libs -- regenerated by `cargo ndk` / `make android`.
*.so

